  "html": "<article id=\"post-5562\" class=\"container post-5562 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow center-content-mobile full-width-mobile has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-red-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-info\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2\">HVAC, Plumbing &amp; Indoor Air Quality Services in Mebane, NC </h1>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services serves both sides of Mebane&#8217;s Alamance-Orange county line with heating and cooling, plumbing, and indoor air quality work, priced upfront and reachable 24/7. Mebane pairs a walkable historic core, long associated with White Furniture, with some of the region&#8217;s fastest residential growth along the I-40/I-85 corridor, and the two halves of town need different things from us.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Downtown&#8217;s older homes carry aging systems, retrofit ductwork, and supply pipe from the furniture-era decades. The new subdivisions carry builder-grade equipment that ages on a predictable clock. A single Mebane route can include a repipe consultation in the historic core and a warranty-preserving tune-up in a two-year-old build, and our trucks are stocked for both.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-1 full-width-mobile is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"badge mb-3\" style='min-height:unset;'>\n    <div class=\"badge__content\">\n        <svg width=\"45\" height=\"45\" viewBox=\"0 0 45 45\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <title>Google</title>\n            <path d=\"M42.0046 22.9145C42.0046 21.4661 41.8746 20.0733 41.6332 18.7363H22.395V26.647H33.3882C32.9054 29.191 31.457 31.3451 29.2844 32.7935V37.9373H35.9137C39.7762 34.372 42.0046 29.1353 42.0046 22.9145Z\" fill=\"#4285F4\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 42.8766C27.9112 42.8766 32.535 41.0568 35.9147 37.9371L29.2854 32.7933C27.4655 34.0189 25.1443 34.7617 22.396 34.7617C17.0851 34.7617 12.5727 31.1777 10.9571 26.3496H4.16064V31.6234C7.52175 38.2899 14.4111 42.8766 22.396 42.8766Z\" fill=\"#34A853\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10.9608 26.3308C10.5523 25.1052 10.3109 23.8053 10.3109 22.4498C10.3109 21.0942 10.5523 19.7943 10.9608 18.5687V13.2949H4.16436C2.77164 16.0432 1.97314 19.1444 1.97314 22.4498C1.97314 25.7551 2.77164 28.8563 4.16436 31.6046L9.45671 27.4821L10.9608 26.3308Z\" fill=\"#FBBC05\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 10.155C25.4043 10.155 28.0783 11.1949 30.2138 13.2004L36.0633 7.35097C32.5165 4.04557 27.9112 2.02148 22.396 2.02148C14.4111 2.02148 7.52175 6.60818 4.16064 13.2933L10.9571 18.567C12.5727 13.7389 17.0851 10.155 22.396 10.155Z\" fill=\"#EA4335\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container\">\n            <p class=\"h6 badge__content__rating-container__title\">Google Rating</p>\n            <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars\">\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__number\">\n                    5                </div>\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container\">\n                    <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"/images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"Happy Home team dedicated to providing top quality HVAC, Plumbing, and Indoor Air Quality all across Raleigh-Durham\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/10/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-10-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow pb-4 has-secondary-inverse-color has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wrap-mobile flow pb-4 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4 is-horizontal is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-cdbf0242 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-db3ccc14 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Heating and Cooling on Both Sides of the Line </h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Gas service covers most of Mebane, so furnaces, heat pumps, and hybrids all run here, and the Piedmont&#8217;s humid summers and swinging winters keep each of them busy.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/cooling/air-conditioning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Conditioning Services in Mebane</strong></a>&nbsp;Installation, replacement, repair, and tune-ups on every major brand, with honest repair-versus-replace guidance when an older unit begins failing.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/heating/gas-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Gas Furnaces and Heat Pumps in Mebane</strong></a>&nbsp;Furnaces heat the established neighborhoods while heat pumps dominate the new subdivisions, and we install and&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;both along with hybrid pairings that switch fuels for efficiency.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/cooling/mini-split\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Ductless Mini-Split Systems</strong></a>&nbsp;Older downtown homes without ductwork and newer homes with an unmanageable bonus room share the same answer:&nbsp;a mini-split conditioning that space&nbsp;independently,&nbsp;no renovation&nbsp;required.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indoor Air Quality for a Town Growing Fast </h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pollen and humidity reach every Mebane home, entering older houses through leaky ducts and crawl spaces and lingering in newer ones behind tight construction.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/dehumidifiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Whole-Home and Crawlspace Dehumidifiers</strong></a>: Humidity held in range protects old framing downtown and keeps sealed new builds from turning stuffy.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality/air-ducts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Duct Cleaning and Sealing</strong></a>: Leaky runs waste conditioned air in homes of every age. Sealing and cleaning restore efficiency and air quality together.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality/air-purifiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Filtration and Purification</strong></a>: High-efficiency filtration cuts the indoor pollen load through the long allergy season.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plumbing From the Historic Core to the New Streets </h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Mebane&#8217;s municipal water comes from Graham-Mebane Lake and arrives treated and&nbsp;relatively soft, keeping softeners off most in-town lists. What the town&#8217;s plumbing&nbsp;actually presents&nbsp;is a split workload: end-of-life pipe downtown, aging builder-installed water heaters in the subdivisions, and wells on the rural edges.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/repiping-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Repiping and Pipe Repair</strong></a>&nbsp;Furniture-era homes hide galvanized&nbsp;pipe&nbsp;that&nbsp;has&nbsp;been narrowing for decades.&nbsp;Repiping&nbsp;ends the pressure loss and discoloration in one project, ideally timed with a renovation.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-heater-installation-replacements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Water Heater Installation and Replacement</strong></a>&nbsp;From a tired unit in an older home to a builder-installed tank now out of warranty, we replace tank units, install&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/tankless-water-heaters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">tankless systems</a>&nbsp;where endless hot water fits the household, and size&nbsp;either correctly.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/frozen-burst-pipe-repair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Frozen and Burst Pipe Repair</strong></a>&nbsp;Freezes find under-insulated lines in old crawl spaces and new garages alike. We stop the water quickly and repair the break.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/kitchen-bathroom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Kitchen and Bathroom Plumbing</strong></a>&nbsp;Fixture work priced before it starts, in a downtown bungalow or a new build. Rural properties on the town&#8217;s edges can schedule&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/plumbing/well-pump\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">well pump service</a>, and&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-treatment-filtration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">filtration</a>&nbsp;is available for anyone wanting&nbsp;better-tasting&nbsp;water.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">One Standard Across the County Line </h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Old house or new, Alamance side or Orange, the process holds: diagnose the fault, present the price in writing, then do the work, with honest, upfront pricing and a 100% money-back guarantee behind it. Our trained technicians handle both generations of Mebane homes daily. Call, chat, or book online to schedule service. </p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Frequently Asked Questions </h4>\n\n<div  class=\"accordion\" style=\"--_accordion-separator-color: #076395\">\n            <details class=\"accordion-item\" data-custom-open=\"true\" open>\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Is 24/7 service available on both sides of the Mebane county line? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Yes. Coverage runs around the clock across the Alamance and Orange sides alike, including nights, weekends, and holidays. </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Do you handle both historic and brand-new homes in Mebane? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Yes, often with same-day service. Repiping and mini-split retrofits in the historic core and warranty-preserving maintenance in the new subdivisions are both standard work for us.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Is Mebane&#8217;s water hard enough to need a softener? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>For in-town homes, generally not. The Graham-Mebane Lake supply arrives treated and relatively soft, and taste-focused filtration is the more useful upgrade. Wells outside town get a water test before any recommendation.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">My newer Mebane home came with a builder-installed water heater. When should it be replaced? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Most tank units last ten to fifteen years, and builder-installed heaters across Mebane&#8217;s growth-era subdivisions are reaching that window now. Replacing on your own schedule avoids the leak that otherwise announces the failure. </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Which surrounding towns does the Mebane coverage area include? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Efland, Haw River, and Graham are all within range, along with the wider Alamance and Orange county area. The Service Areas menu holds the complete list.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow py-5\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Powered by NearU — We’re here to make your HVAC Service experience the best one yet!</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"430\" height=\"98\" src=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png\" alt=\"NearU\" class=\"wp-image-36\" style=\"width:220px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png 430w, /images/2024/02/NearU-300x68.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 100vw, 430px\" /></figure>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">NearU is setting up a new standard of HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our companies with better resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. If you’ve recently learned that your go-to HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator company has joined NearU, then this is something to get excited about! We protect the people and culture that make each company great, while ensuring their customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-5562 -->"
}